    u "DeepSeek 其实练习得很认真。" id story_ch03_08c4e051d76d_1
    voice voice_file("v_0dcbbacefecf")
    cl "我知道。" id story_ch03_0dcbbacefecf_2
    voice voice_file("v_4925a57e0f4d")
    u "学姐也帮了很多忙。" id story_ch03_4925a57e0f4d_1
    voice voice_file("v_619b72264ae2")
    cl "……我也知道。" id story_ch03_619b72264ae2_1
    narrator "她突然合上琴盖。" id story_ch03_62f5952141cb_1
    ## 演出: 音效 咔哒。
    voice voice_file("v_8517678f9232")
    u "怎么了？" id story_ch03_8517678f9232_2
    voice voice_file("v_7dcb22443886")
    cl "没什么。" id story_ch03_7dcb22443886_1
    voice voice_file("v_953c842f8a04")
    u "你生气了？" id story_ch03_953c842f8a04_1
    voice voice_file("v_407313caf77a")
    cl "没有。" id story_ch03_407313caf77a_1
    voice voice_file("v_79df7f199e31")
    u "可是——" id story_ch03_79df7f199e31_1
    voice voice_file("v_8ee37bcbff03")
    cl "我说没有就是没有！" id story_ch03_8ee37bcbff03_1
    narrator "她转过头。" id story_ch03_8f02e27534e7_1
    narrator "脸颊微微泛红。" id story_ch03_de74fd463753_1
    voice voice_file("v_f1a328a5d153")
    cl "你这个人，真的很迟钝。" id story_ch03_f1a328a5d153_1
    voice voice_file("v_5f55f500d924")
    u "……" id story_ch03_5f55f500d924_6
    voice voice_file("v_77b5ec95409b")
    cl "明明是你先说要和我交往的。" id story_ch03_77b5ec95409b_1
    voice voice_file("v_366f3f29574c")
    cl "结果从那以后，你总是忙着别的事情。" id story_ch03_366f3f29574c_1
    voice voice_file("v_4353df989113")
    cl "学习也好，电影也好，那个 DeepSeek 也好，还有 GPT 学姐……" id story_ch03_4353df989113_1
    narrator "她的声音渐渐低了下来。" id story_ch03_b17ffa2f6be4_1
    voice voice_file("v_ec29ab74a83d")
    cl "我知道你有很多事情要做。" id story_ch03_ec29ab74a83d_1
    voice voice_file("v_735e27b11d17")
    cl "我也不是那种非要男朋友每天陪着自己的女生。" id story_ch03_735e27b11d17_1
    voice voice_file("v_85e2f7be1122")
    cl "可是……" id story_ch03_85e2f7be1122_1
    narrator "她攥紧裙角。" id story_ch03_e03fd0539066_1
    voice voice_file("v_4061bcf069bd")
    cl "你至少应该偶尔想起我吧。" id story_ch03_4061bcf069bd_1
    ## 演出: 旁白
    narrator "我愣住了。" id story_ch03_8e1a451c2128_2
    narrator "从认识 Claude 到现在，她从来没有这样直接地表达过自己的感情。" id story_ch03_5176b9b9776a_1
    narrator "在我的印象里，她总是自信、骄傲。" id story_ch03_50efd785f2a6_1
    narrator "无论遇到什么事情，都像是能够轻而易举地解决。" id story_ch03_5b85b9c23d4b_1
    narrator "我几乎忘记了。" id story_ch03_1328e511f8ef_1
    narrator "即使是她，也会因为被忽视而难过。" id story_ch03_22cdf66ada5e_1
    voice voice_file("v_4c658b378563")
    u "对不起。" id story_ch03_4c658b378563_1
    voice voice_file("v_d6bb00ebdcec")
    cl "……" id story_ch03_d6bb00ebdcec_4
    voice voice_file("v_e7c8b900c8a6")
    u "这段时间，我确实没有考虑你的感受。" id story_ch03_e7c8b900c8a6_1
    voice voice_file("v_565e457c4e12")
    cl "……我又不是想听你道歉。" id story_ch03_565e457c4e12_1
    voice voice_file("v_82b2a19b9b5b")
    u "那你想听什么？" id story_ch03_82b2a19b9b5b_1
    narrator "她抬起头。" id story_ch03_54b76a6e010c_1
    narrator "目光与我相遇。" id story_ch03_b689c3caf0d7_1
    voice voice_file("v_7c53e5287fd9")
    cl "我想知道……" id story_ch03_7c53e5287fd9_1
    narrator "她停住了。" id story_ch03_3311f2cffd34_1
    narrator "像是在努力寻找一个不会让自己显得太狼狈的说法。" id story_ch03_f1a0b2a8f7a8_1
    voice voice_file("v_20eb6620536b")
    cl "你当初为什么向我告白？" id story_ch03_20eb6620536b_1
    ## 演出: 旁白
    narrator "我的心突然沉了一下。" id story_ch03_52b8a868ce74_1
    narrator "操场。" id story_ch03_014a1c92b505_1
    narrator "单杠。" id story_ch03_de2567b78abb_1
    narrator "那场荒唐的告白。" id story_ch03_62a47bbac088_1
    narrator "以及我原本想寻找的、天台上的蓝发少女。" id story_ch03_7e067a8ec480_1
    narrator "那些被我刻意忽略的记忆，突然全部涌了上来。" id story_ch03_6abf913c5579_1
    voice voice_file("v_72fc6dc16443")
    cl "你喜欢我什么？" id story_ch03_72fc6dc16443_1
    voice voice_file("v_5f55f500d924")
    u "……" id story_ch03_5f55f500d924_7
    voice voice_file("v_02fa788e6912")
    cl "是因为我长得漂亮？" id story_ch03_02fa788e6912_1
    voice voice_file("v_505f7ecca255")
    cl "还是因为听说我家里很有钱？" id story_ch03_505f7ecca255_1
    voice voice_file("v_ea9323e41e23")
    cl "又或者……" id story_ch03_ea9323e41e23_1
    narrator "她勉强笑了一下。" id story_ch03_8e8735cb1a8d_1
    voice voice_file("v_e47f384a97af")
    cl "你只是觉得，向我告白很有趣？" id story_ch03_e47f384a97af_1
    scene art_act03_cg_c308_claude_confession with trans_dissolve
    voice voice_file("v_ab45f9f9814a")
    u "不是这样的。" id story_ch03_ab45f9f9814a_1
    voice voice_file("v_4016a25a7e57")
    cl "那是怎样？" id story_ch03_4016a25a7e57_1
